{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.colorTwist_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.colorTwist_eq","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L95-L95","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.colorTwist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.colorTwist","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L90-L93","doc":"The color-twist accumulated by a $k = +1$ sector over the full\ndivisor traversal of latitude length `T`.  At `T = π` this is\nthe substrate-parameter advance of `q π`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords.flow_active_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords.flow_active_neg","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L81-L84","doc":"Corollary: partner active sectors ($k = -1$) advance at rate $-q$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords.flow_active_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords.flow_active_pos","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L76-L79","doc":"Corollary: leading active sectors ($k = +1$) advance at rate $+q$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords.flow_spectator","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords.flow_spectator","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L72-L74","doc":"Corollary: spectator sectors ($k = 0$) are stationary. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords.flow_rate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords.flow_rate","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L65-L65","doc":"A sector with rate `k` advances at angular rate $k\\,q$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords.flow_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords.flow_add","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L62-L62","doc":"Additive composition in the flow parameter (rate preserved\nacross the composition step). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords.flow_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords.flow_zero","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L59-L59","doc":"Identity at $t = 0$ regardless of rate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords.flow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords.flow","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L57-L57","doc":"The flow on the angular coordinate.  `k` is the signed\nrate multiplier under the current braid generator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords.mk","kind":"ctor","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.QReebFlowOnColorCoords","kind":"class","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L43-L66","doc":"The $q$-Reeb flow on color-sector coordinates.\n\n`flow q t k ψ` is the angular position $\\psi'$ of a sector\nafter applying the flow $\\phi^q_t$ to the starting position\n$\\psi$, given the sector's signed rate multiplier `k : ℤ`\nunder the current braid generator.\n\nSectors with rate `k` advance at angular rate `k * q`; in\nparticular `k = 0` gives the spectator rule and `k = ±1` the\ncentre-of-mass-preserving two-strand action.  Composition is\nadditive in $t$. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:q-reeb-flow-on-color-coords","label":"def:q-reeb-flow-on-color-coords","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/q-reeb-flow-on-color-coords.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.instReprColorSector.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.instReprColorSector.repr","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.instReprColorSector","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.instReprColorSector","kind":"instance","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.instDecidableEqColorSector","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.instDecidableEqColorSector","kind":"instance","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.ColorSector.blue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.ColorSector.blue","kind":"ctor","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L40-L40","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.ColorSector.green","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.ColorSector.green","kind":"ctor","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L39-L39","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.ColorSector.red","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.ColorSector.red","kind":"ctor","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.ColorSector","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.ColorSector","kind":"inductive","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/CategoricalReeb/QReebFlowOnColorCoords.lean#L34-L41","doc":"The three color sectors over the exceptional divisor.  Each\nsector carries an angular coordinate $\\psi$; the latitude\ncoordinate $\\phi$ is shared. ","signatureChunk":0}]}